"│  adapter*       ‹payload›                                                    │"
"│▸ url*           h_                                                           │"
"│  env var NAME*  PORTER_PAYLOAD_API_KEY                                       │"
"│  config_dir     path to the CMS project                                      │"
"│    reads PORTER_PAYLOAD_API_KEY — not set ✗                                  │"
